%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4c838816cb2c9cf45a5ebad848cfff5b, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Encounters.TutorialScript
  _lines:
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dba59e8e3734b7f4b83f27338668e95b, type: 2}
    Trigger: 0
    Turn: 1
    Text: Click a pilot in your hand, then a highlighted slot, to place it. Placing
      costs 1 AP, and you have 3 AP every turn.
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dba59e8e3734b7f4b83f27338668e95b, type: 2}
    Trigger: 0
    Turn: 1
    Text: Pilots form chains from the root (the bottom slot) outward. The red value
      is your attack on the enemy, the blue value your defense against its hit. Press
      Play Turn when you are ready.
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dba59e8e3734b7f4b83f27338668e95b, type: 2}
    Trigger: 1
    Turn: 2
    Text: Pilots stay on the board between turns. Their defense takes the enemy's
      hits; the blue bar shows what is left. Hover anything to learn more.
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c79952171acde5543adaf2cf3ac610f7, type: 2}
    Trigger: 0
    Turn: 1
    Text: 'A locked slot: the text under the lock says when it opens. A chain only
      counts up to its first empty slot, so fill it from the root outward.'
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 55cf42afd63512843898a282fc6e0f68, type: 2}
    Trigger: 0
    Turn: 1
    Text: 'The board splits: one branch attacks, the other defends, and the root
      counts for both. The x slot multiplies everything before it.'
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 55cf42afd63512843898a282fc6e0f68, type: 2}
    Trigger: 2
    Turn: 1
    Text: A hit equal to a chain's defense leaves it standing at 0. The next hit
      that reaches it breaks it.
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 55cf42afd63512843898a282fc6e0f68, type: 2}
    Trigger: 3
    Turn: 1
    Text: A broken chain's pilots fall and block their slots. Place a new pilot on
      a fallen one to clear it.
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 92bda8b75849b6b4c90cc1b560ad134d, type: 2}
    Trigger: 0
    Turn: 1
    Text: 'New: you can place a pilot on top of another (a replace). The replaced
      pilot goes back to your hand, where it recovers defense every turn.'
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 92bda8b75849b6b4c90cc1b560ad134d, type: 2}
    Trigger: 4
    Turn: 1
    Text: 'A fresh enemy. Worn pilots can rest: click one and choose Eject. An ejected
      pilot that rests a whole turn in your hand recovers twice as fast.'
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ba75165afa3199943bd64cd0789f2ad8, type: 2}
    Trigger: 0
    Turn: 1
    Text: 'Ejecting also dodges: a pilot that is not on the board cannot be hit.
      The damage reaches you instead, but the pilot survives.'
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ce09d39a4b3abdc44a091d30febc05c5, type: 2}
    Trigger: 0
    Turn: 1
    Text: 'This locked slot can be opened now by paying AP: click it.'
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 759977f9fb0a0164cae460db6c021532, type: 2}
    Trigger: 0
    Turn: 1
    Text: Bolt has an ability, Surge. Place Bolt, then click it to use the ability
      (once per battle, it costs AP). A glow marks a pilot whose ability is ready.
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 759977f9fb0a0164cae460db6c021532, type: 2}
    Trigger: 10
    Turn: 1
    Text: Surge doubles Bolt's attack this turn, then its attack drops to 0 until
      it rests in your hand. Plan the swap.
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2445fde2610969549845bc81838c3a88, type: 2}
    Trigger: 6
    Turn: 1
    Text: 'The enemy aims a snipe at the marked pilot: -50% to both its stats next
      turn. Swap the pilot out to dodge it, or take the hit.'
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2445fde2610969549845bc81838c3a88, type: 2}
    Trigger: 7
    Turn: 1
    Text: 'A snipe aimed at a pilot with nothing left assassinates it: the pilot
      falls.'
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0eecf380231bbda4eab568e88890216a, type: 2}
    Trigger: 0
    Turn: 1
    Text: 'A subtract slot is a toll: its pilot''s stat is taken away from the chain.
      Put your weakest pilot there (0 pays nothing); the x2 bonus after it is the
      reward. Toll pilots are never wounded.'
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0eecf380231bbda4eab568e88890216a, type: 2}
    Trigger: 1
    Turn: 2
    Text: 'The enemy hunkers down: a big guard and no attack. Brash''s No Guard halves
      both sides'' defense this turn, which costs you nothing while the enemy is
      not attacking.'
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b30786470eb698f4194bf29f90ac94d4, type: 2}
    Trigger: 0
    Turn: 1
    Text: A divide slot divides the chain by its pilot's stat. Dividing by less than
      1 multiplies! Dividing by 0 is a very bad idea.
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e9d8e73ef32d37449a447a066d7a2a3, type: 2}
    Trigger: 0
    Turn: 1
    Text: 'Defense can multiply too: the x slot on the blue chain multiplies everything
      before it.'
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e9d8e73ef32d37449a447a066d7a2a3, type: 2}
    Trigger: 8
    Turn: 1
    Text: 'The ram is charging: a big guard now and a huge Unleash next turn. Break
      through the whole guard this turn and it is stunned instead.'
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e9d8e73ef32d37449a447a066d7a2a3, type: 2}
    Trigger: 9
    Turn: 1
    Text: 'Charge broken: the Unleash will not happen.'
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dd744bbe49865054985066c78cb2bf61, type: 2}
    Trigger: 0
    Turn: 1
    Text: 'Two lanes: each enemy attacks the defense on its side, and each side''s
      attack hits its own enemy. 3 AP for both fronts: choose where to spend them.'
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d9858bc7f0424ed499661c9aca069bf9, type: 2}
    Trigger: 0
    Turn: 1
    Text: The hub slot feeds all four chains. Strong, but both enemies wear it down,
      and if it breaks every chain is cut.
  - Encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eee376dfa28ba7c42801fa0b1911c383, type: 2}
    Trigger: 5
    Turn: 1
    Text: 'The warden will lock the marked pilot: it cannot be replaced or ejected
      for 2 turns. Swap it out now if you want it free.'
